    "en": {
      "trackName": "Robo Attack for Watch",
      "description": "Blast waves of rogue robots in this fast-paced retro arcade shooter for Apple Watch and iPhone!\n\nInspired by classics like Robotron and Berzerk, Robo Attack delivers thrilling gameplay in bite-sized bursts — right on your wrist or phone.\n\nFeatures\n• Retro arcade-style pixel graphics\n• Fast-paced enemy waves\n• Power-ups: Shield, Triple Shot, Rapid Fire & Time Freeze\n• Smooth 60fps performance on Apple Watch\n• Crown-based Watch controls + iPhone swipes\n• Retro sound effects, music & voiceovers\n• Short-burst gameplay perfect for mobile\n• Play anywhere, anytime — no internet needed\n• No ads and no IAP!\n\nRelive the glory days of the arcade — now on your wrist.\n\nThanks for playing\nJohnno & Pete",
      "releaseNotes": "This app has been updated by Apple to prepare for watchOS 27 compatibility. No new features are included.\n\n- Fixed up iPad start screen layout\n- Fixed an issue where sound and voices sometimes stopped playing\n- Modified laser sound so it is less jarring\n\nThanks for playing,\nJohnno and Pete",
